<title>INDIA: Indian annualised interest rate on forward dollars.</title>
<headline>Indian annualised interest rate on forward dollars.</headline>
<dateline>BOMBAY 1997-04-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following are monthly annualised interest rates on forward dollar premia quoted by banks and brokers at 1600 IST. The rates are spot/one month to spot/six months.</p>
<p>	    C/S =  1.60 %		     C/S =  1.91 %</p>
<p>	    O/N =  2.54 %		     O/N =  1.27 %</p>
<p>	    T/N =  1.70 %		     T/N =  1.27 %</p>
<p>		   April 3, 1997		    April 2, 1997</p>
<p>	  1 month forward =  6.11 %     1 month forward =  5.43 %</p>
<p>	  2 month forward =  6.45 %     2 month forward =  6.28 %</p>
<p>	  3 month forward =  6.79 %     3 month forward =  6.79 %</p>
<p>	  4 month forward =  6.96 %     4 month forward =  6.87 %</p>
<p>	  5 month forward =  7.06 %     5 month forward =  7.06 %</p>
<p>	  6 month forward =  6.92 %     6 month forward =  6.92 %</p>
<p>-- Bombay newsroom, 91-22-265 9000</p>
